sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Session A
    participant DB as advisory lock 12345
    participant B as Session B

    A->>DB: pg_advisory_lock(12345)
    DB-->>A: acquired immediately
    B->>DB: pg_advisory_lock(12345)
    Note right of B: blocks - lock already held
    A->>DB: pg_advisory_unlock(12345)
    DB-->>A: released
    DB-->>B: unblocks immediately
    Note over A,B: B was parked waiting, not polling - woken the instant A released
